Z||000000||Greg Piet||11-16-1999||01:14 AM||||I just purchased a 12 disc changer and receiver from <A HREF="http://www.electronicsoutlet.com." TARGET=_blank>www.electronicsoutlet.com.</A>   Before going through the actual installation, I hooked up the stereo and changer to my 12V power supply(I always bench test before installation), and the CD changer actually ate a CD!<BR>I even followed the cd changer setup instructions!<P>I didnt have this problem with my old Blaupunkt!  I just sent an email to the company of purchase, but no answer yet!<P>So in summary, be wary of JVC, and MAYBE dont do business with electronicsoutlet.com  ||||reg||1
Z||000001||olympic||11-16-1999||01:00 PM||||  Thats why I only deal with local retailers when it comes to car stereo equipment(and most other stuff). It may cost a couple of bucks extra but I've blown a couple of subs and they replaced them on the spot, no questions asked. Also, they usually will give you free install advice and free wire,connectors, etc.||||reg||1
Z||000002||RFMike||11-16-1999||11:07 PM||||Just my .02, but I have purchased a lot of computer gear online, and have never had a problem.  I'm sure you can, but I always buy a product that is covered by the manufacturer's warranty, and get it in advance.  I generally don't buy oem, unless it is a processor.||||reg||1
Z||000003||DJRice||11-17-1999||09:39 AM||||I have found that cructhfield gives you too much good stuff not to buy from them.  You buy the radio you get all installtion materials plus pictures and instructions.  If you add a matching changer, they shave $50 off the price.  Shipping is quick, and tech support is very helpful if needed, but you usually get what you need in the box.  They even cover the return shipping if you have a problem.<P>I have bought 3 systems from crutchfield and have not been dissappointed yet.||||reg||1
Z||000004||batboy||11-17-1999||02:12 PM||||I agree about Crutchfield's. They are the only mail order stereo outfit I'd ever give my business to. I've bought many things from them over the years and so have several of my friends.||||reg||1
